+# Packet 100 Research
+
+## Observed Authority
+
+- Active blocker: task-orchestrator item `dcf66b56-8fbf-426f-a6d6-826f0caa5822`, `DMX-CONPORT-OPTIMAL-100-migration-foundation-gate`, role `blocked`.
